    LR-QAOA: J. A. Montanez-Barrera, K. Michielsen, 'Toward a linear-ramp QAOA protocol: evidence of a scaling advantage in solving some combinatorial optimization problems', npj Quantum Information 11, 131 (2025), doi:10.1038/s41534-025-01082-1, arXiv:2405.09169
